{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can You Pass a Spy Agency\u2019s Interview?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Agent of Veil</i> is a cozy puzzle adventure filled with secrets, puzzles, puns, and a suspicious number of hidden compartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle your way into the covert world of espionage as a potential recruit for the elusive VEIL agency, where you must pass an unconventional spy interview, solve puzzles, answer quirky questions and uncover hidden agency secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/about_solve_puzzles.png?t=1742842956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your skills to the test with a variety of puzzles, ranging from classic ciphers to unconventional spy interview questions. Gather clues, decode mysterious messages and navigate a world where every solved puzzle brings you closer to the agency\u2019s well-guarded secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/puzzles.gif?t=1742842956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/about_uncoversecrets.png?t=1742842956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While your new office is the place where you\u2019ll begin to uncover the agency\u2019s secrets, it is also a place full of intriguing mysteries of its own. Encrypted documents, secret rooms, and coded messages are just the tip of the iceberg.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/about_veilUncover.png?t=1742842956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/about_apartofveil.png?t=1742842956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll learn about fellow agents and get a taste of the drama that comes with the high-pressure world of espionage. Can you solve encrypted messages while dodging the real problems, like the passive-aggressive notes about the &quot;missing&quot; stapler?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/extras/about_coll.png?t=1742842956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to step into a world where puzzles are just the beginning?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520570?t=1742842956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742842956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/6ec23020b1d4263e7726ae8777c4551a1452b9d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742842956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520570/6ec23020b1d4263e7726ae8777c4551a1452b9d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742842956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can You Pass a Spy Agency\u2019s Interview?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Agent of Veil</i> is a cozy puzzle adventure filled with secrets, puzzles, puns, and a suspicious number of hidden compartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle your way into the covert world of espionage as a potential recruit for the elusive VEIL agency, where you must pass an unconventional spy interview, solve puzzles, answer quirky questions and uncover hidden agency secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"